  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1750445076_2473018_286b50b0d0604fcd1513b744fe10c8d7.jpg",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(25, 32, 43); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\" id=\"isPasted\">We are SKROOZ, a division of TARA Labs, Inc. The world’s most award-winning high-end audio cable brand since 1986.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(25, 32, 43); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">For 40 years we've manufactured premium electronics cables designed for tech enthusiasts, gamers, audiophiles, and professionals. We deliver unparalleled performance &amp; durability, &nbsp;through decades of engineering cable expertise that enhance &amp; improve any setup.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(25, 32, 43); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">We're looking to partner with influencers who are passionate about technology, keen on showcasing high-quality products, and have an engaged audience interested in tech reviews, setup guides, product comparisons, or general electronics content.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(25, 32, 43); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">You'll receive our top-of-the-line HDMI 2.1 cable, USB-C 4.0 Gen3 cable, and CAT8 ethernet cables to review and integrate into your content. Our cables feature lighting fast data transfer, unsurpassed durability, universal compatibility and premium materials including Kevlar reinforced and gold-plated connectors. Backed by our LIFETIME WARRANTY!&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(25, 32, 43); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">We offer 10% Commission of Retail price ($14.95 per cable) and large performance bonuses. If you're ready to elevate your content and introduce your audience to the future of Premium Brand cables we invite you to apply.</span></p></div></div>",
